## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of amortized streaming updates, approximate order statistics, and tradeoffs between fixed memory, accuracy, and per-batch work.

## Key Concepts
- Fixed-size sketches; hashing; bucketed histograms
- Rank estimation from histograms; error-variance tradeoffs
- Amortized analysis: batch updates vs query cost

## Code Example
```javascript
// sketch init
const d=3, s=1024;
const H = Array.from({length:d}, ()=>new Array(s).fill(0));
function update(v){
  for(let j=0;j<d;j++){ const b=hash_j(v,j)%s; H[j][b]++; }
}
function rankEstimate(r){ let sum=0; for(let b=0;b<=r;b++) sum+=Math.min(...H.map(h=>h[b])); return sum; }
```

## Why This Is Asked

